sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor AD as Admin
  participant C as React client
  participant A as Express API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  actor M as Team member
  AD->>C: Add member with login, employee ID, permissions
  C->>A: POST /api/team-members
  A->>A: Admin only, normalise permissions
  A->>A: Generate temporary password, bcrypt hash
  A->>D: INSERT team member (must change = true)
  A->>D: Activity log
  A-->>C: 201 member + temporary password (once)
  C-->>AD: Show temporary password
  AD-->>M: Share Warehouse ID, ID and password
  AD->>C: Later: change permissions or disable
  C->>A: PUT /api/team-members/:id
  A->>D: UPDATE permissions / status
  M->>A: Next request with existing token
  A->>D: Read current status and permissions
  A-->>M: Allowed, or 403 if removed / disabled
